Because, you know everyone, well, speaking of the Koyori "Wakarite" Championship, it's these three.

84
00:04:42,500 --> 00:04:43,760
うん、あちら女子くん、
Yeah, over there is Josh-kun—

85
00:04:43,760 --> 00:04:44,380
あちら女子くん！
—over there is Josh-kun!

86
00:04:44,380 --> 00:04:44,750
うん。
Yeah.

87
00:04:44,890 --> 00:04:46,330
かなりタイトな友人。
Quite a tight friend.

88
00:04:46,330 --> 00:04:47,370
よろしくお願いします！
Nice to meet you!

89
00:04:47,370 --> 00:04:48,510
どうなったのか、ホールフラップは！
